<title>USA: First Essex Bancorp Q1 net unchanged.</title>
<headline>First Essex Bancorp Q1 net unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ANDOVER, Mass. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.28		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net		 2,147		    1,754</p>
<p> Total assets    1,146,854		801,455</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  7,706		    6,162</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 results reflect return to full 42 percent tax rate due to complete utilization of loss carryovers. Pre-tax income was $3.7 million, compared to $1.8 million for Q1 1996, although earnings per share were flat.</p>
</text>
